### Ask the copilot — streaming response (SSE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/ask
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sessionId": null,
  "message": "Oxirgi 7 kunda qaysi agentda transferlar ko'paydi va nega?"
}

### Ask the copilot — a new conversation (JSON response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/ask
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sessionId": null,
  "message": "Oxirgi 7 kunda qaysi agentda transferlar ko'paydi va nega?"
}

### Continue the conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "message": "Shu agentning system prompt'iga transfer qoidasini qo'shib, qoralamaga yoz"
}

### My conversations
POST http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/sessions/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 20 }

### One conversation in full (tool calls included)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/sessions/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Delete a conversation
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/sessions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
